          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<ul><li>Shopping-center sign rules often limit colors and sizes; ask your landlord before finalizing.</li><li>Design a version that fits a narrow storefront sign band.</li><li>Use your logo consistently on Google, Facebook and Nextdoor, where Cedar Park customers compare local businesses.</li><li>Consider apparel versions if staff wear branded shirts.</li></ul>",
